{#
  The Gallery, Markdown family. One Race's Image Assets, art and names only —
  the rules stay in the Race Overview, one link away at the anchor that page
  already gives every record (ADR 0031).

  The LaTeX twin at `latex/gallery/main.tex.jinja` shows the same entries in
  the same order, and carries no links: a printed sheet cannot be clicked.

  Captions link across to the Race Overview's `.html`, the Format this family
  publishes to. A Race Target depicts no record, so its caption is plain text.

  Layout lives here and not in the view-model, which says only *which* Asset
  an entry shows (ADR 0017); `image_src` spells it for wherever this document
  lands.
#}
# {{ source.title }} — Gallery

*v{{ spf_version }}*
{% for entry in source.entries %}
![{{ entry.name }}]({{ entry.image | image_src }})

{% if entry.anchor -%}
**[{{ entry.name }}](../race-overview/{{ source.race }}.html#{{ entry.anchor }})**
{%- else -%}
**{{ entry.name }}**
{%- endif %}
{% endfor %}
